            <listPerson>
                <person xml:id="BET01" sex="1">
                    <persName>
                        <roleName/>
                        <forename>William Henry West</forename>
                        <surname>Betty</surname>
                        <addName/>
                    </persName>
                    <birth when="1791-09-03">
                        <placeName/>
                    </birth>
                    <death when="1874-08-24"/>
                    <occupation>actor</occupation>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Betty was a child prodigy actor who played many significant roles on the London stage when he was a teenager. He was immensely popular for a number of 
    years before the novelty wore off. Godwin spent some time trying to get him to play the main role in his 1807 tragedy <title>Faulkener</title>, 
      both by calling on Betty and by talking to Richard Wroughton.</p>
                    </note>
